#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A free IBM course on quantum information and computation"
msgstr "IBM의 양자 정보 및 계산 무료 강좌"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inner products and projections"
msgstr "내적과 사영"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Biggr, operatorname */}\n"
"To better prepare ourselves to explore the capabilities and limitations of quantum circuits, we now introduce some additional mathematical concepts — namely the *inner product* between vectors (and its connection to the Euclidean norm), the notions of *orthogonality* and *orthonormality* for sets of vectors, and *projection* matrices, which will allow us to introduce a handy generalization of standard basis measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Biggr, operatorname */}\n"
"양자 Circuit의 역량과 한계를 더 잘 탐구하기 위한 준비로, 이제 몇 가지 추가적인 수학 개념을 소개합니다. 구체적으로는 벡터 사이의 *내적*(inner product)(그리고 유클리드 노름과의 연관성), 벡터 집합에 대한 *직교성*(orthogonality)과 *정규 직교성*(orthonormality) 개념, 그리고 *사영*(projection) 행렬을 다룰 것입니다. 사영 행렬은 표준 기저 측정의 편리한 일반화를 가능하게 해 줍니다.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Inner products {#inner-products}"
msgstr "내적 {#inner-products}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Recall that when we use the Dirac notation to refer to an arbitrary column "
"vector as a ket, such as\n"
msgstr "Dirac 표기법에서 임의의 열벡터를 ket으로 나타낼 때, 예를 들어\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the corresponding bra vector is the *conjugate transpose* of this vector:\n"
msgstr "이에 대응하는 bra 벡터는 이 벡터의 *켤레 전치*(conjugate transpose)입니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\bigl(\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\bigl(\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"=\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if we have some classical state set $\\Sigma$ in mind, and we express a column vector as a ket,\n"
"such as\n"
msgstr "또한 고전 상태 집합 $\\Sigma$를 염두에 두고 열벡터를 ket으로 표현할 때, 예를 들어\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "then the corresponding row (or bra) vector is the conjugate transpose\n"
msgstr "이에 대응하는 행(bra) 벡터는 켤레 전치입니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert.\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert.\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We also have that the product of a bra vector and a ket vector, viewed as matrices either having a single row or a single column, results in a scalar.\n"
"Specifically, if we have two column vectors\n"
msgstr ""
"또한 bra 벡터와 ket 벡터의 곱은, 각각 단일 행 또는 단일 열을 갖는 행렬로 보면 스칼라값이 됩니다.\n"
"구체적으로, 두 열벡터가\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "so that the row vector $\\langle \\psi \\vert$ is as in equation $(1),$ then\n"
msgstr "와 같이 주어지고 행벡터 $\\langle \\psi \\vert$가 식 $(1)$과 같다면,\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\beta_1 + \\cdots + \\overline{\\alpha_n}\\beta_n.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\beta_1 + \\cdots + \\overline{\\alpha_n}\\beta_n.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatively, if we have two column vectors that we have written as\n"
msgstr "또는 두 열벡터를\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "so that $\\langle \\psi \\vert$ is the row vector $(2),$ we find that\n"
msgstr "로 쓰고 $\\langle \\psi \\vert$가 행벡터 $(2)$일 때, 다음이 성립합니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle & = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert\\Biggr)\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b\\rangle\\Biggr)\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma}\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_b \\langle a \\vert b \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle & = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert\\Biggr)\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b\\rangle\\Biggr)\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma}\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_b \\langle a \\vert b \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the last equality follows from the observation that $\\langle a \\vert"
" a \\rangle = 1$ and $\\langle a \\vert b \\rangle = 0$ for classical states"
" $a$ and $b$ satisfying $a\\neq b.$\n"
msgstr ""
"여기서 마지막 등호는 고전 상태 $a$와 $b$에 대해 $\\langle a \\vert a \\rangle = 1$이고, $a\\neq"
" b$이면 $\\langle a \\vert b \\rangle = 0$이라는 사실에서 비롯됩니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The value $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle$ is called the *inner product* between the vectors $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$ and $\\vert \\phi \\rangle.$\n"
"Inner products are critically important in quantum information and computation;\n"
"we would not get far in understanding quantum information at a mathematical level without them.\n"
msgstr ""
"값 $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle$를 벡터 $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$와 $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ 사이의 *내적*이라고 합니다.\n"
"내적은 양자 정보와 계산에서 매우 중요하며, 내적 없이는 수학적 수준에서 양자 정보를 깊이 이해하기 어렵습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let us now collect together some basic facts about inner products of "
"vectors.\n"
msgstr "이제 벡터의 내적에 대한 기본적인 성질들을 정리해 보겠습니다.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Relationship to the Euclidean norm.** The inner product of any vector\n"
msgstr "**유클리드 노름과의 관계.** 임의의 벡터\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   with itself is\n"
msgstr "   를 자기 자신과 내적하면\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\alpha_a\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert\\alpha_a\\vert^2\n"
"   = \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\alpha_a\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert\\alpha_a\\vert^2\n"
"   = \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Thus, the Euclidean norm of a vector may alternatively be expressed as\n"
msgstr "   따라서 벡터의 유클리드 노름은 다음과 같이 표현할 수도 있습니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| = \\sqrt{ \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle }.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| = \\sqrt{ \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle }.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Notice that the Euclidean norm of a vector must always be a nonnegative real number.\n"
"   Moreover, the only way the Euclidean norm of a vector can be equal to zero is if every one of the entries is equal to zero, which is to say that the vector is the zero vector.\n"
msgstr ""
"   벡터의 유클리드 노름은 항상 음이 아닌 실수임에 유의하세요.\n"
"   또한 벡터의 유클리드 노름이 0이 되려면 모든 항목이 0이어야 하는데, 이는 곧 그 벡터가 영벡터임을 의미합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   We can summarize these observations like this: for every vector $\\vert "
"\\psi \\rangle$ we have\n"
msgstr "   이를 요약하면, 모든 벡터 $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$에 대해\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\geq 0,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\geq 0,\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   with $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0$ if and only if $\\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0.$\n"
"   This property of the inner product is sometimes referred to as _positive definiteness_.\n"
msgstr ""
"   이고, $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0$인 것은 오직 $\\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0$일 때뿐입니다.\n"
"   내적의 이 성질은 때로 _양의 정치성_(positive definiteness)이라고 불립니다.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Conjugate symmetry.** For any two vectors\n"
msgstr "**켤레 대칭성.** 임의의 두 벡터\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   we have\n"
msgstr "   에 대해\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\beta_a} \\alpha_a,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\beta_a} \\alpha_a,\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   and therefore\n"
msgstr "   이므로\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\overline{\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle} = \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\overline{\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle} = \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Linearity in the second argument (and conjugate linearity in the first).**\n"
"Let us suppose that $\\vert \\psi \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle,$ and $\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle$ are vectors and $\\alpha_1$ and $\\alpha_2$ are complex numbers. If we define a new vector\n"
msgstr ""
"**두 번째 인수에 대한 선형성(그리고 첫 번째 인수에 대한 켤레 선형성).**\n"
"$\\vert \\psi \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle$가 벡터이고 $\\alpha_1,$ $\\alpha_2$가 복소수라고 합시다. 새로운 벡터를\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\phi\\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\phi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\phi_2\\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\phi\\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\phi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\phi_2\\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   then\n"
msgstr "   로 정의하면\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigl( \\alpha_1\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"   = \\alpha_1 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigl( \\alpha_1\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"   = \\alpha_1 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   That is to say, the inner product is _linear_ in the second argument.\n"
"   This can be verified either through the formulas above or simply by noting that matrix multiplication is linear in each argument (and specifically in the second argument).\n"
msgstr ""
"   즉, 내적은 두 번째 인수에 대해 _선형_(linear)입니다.\n"
"   이는 위의 식을 직접 계산하거나, 행렬 곱이 각 인수에 대해(특히 두 번째 인수에 대해) 선형임을 이용하여 확인할 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Combining this fact with conjugate symmetry reveals that the inner "
"product is _conjugate linear_ in the first argument. That is, if $\\vert "
"\\psi_1 \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,$ and $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ "
"are vectors and $\\alpha_1$ and $\\alpha_2$ are complex numbers, and we "
"define\n"
msgstr ""
"   이 사실과 켤레 대칭성을 결합하면, 내적은 첫 번째 인수에 대해 _켤레 선형_(conjugate linear)임을 알 수 있습니다."
" 즉, $\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\phi "
"\\rangle$가 벡터이고 $\\alpha_1,$ $\\alpha_2$가 복소수일 때,\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   =\n"
"   \\bigl( \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\bigr)\n"
"   \\vert\\phi\\rangle\n"
"   = \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert \\phi \\rangle + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\phi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   =\n"
"   \\bigl( \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\bigr)\n"
"   \\vert\\phi\\rangle\n"
"   = \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert \\phi \\rangle + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\phi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The Cauchy–Schwarz inequality.**\n"
"For every choice of vectors $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ and $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ having the same number of entries, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"**코시–슈바르츠 부등식.**\n"
"같은 크기의 벡터 $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$와 $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ 모두에 대해\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\vert \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\bigr| \\leq \\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| \\bigl\\| \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   \\bigr\\|.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\vert \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\bigr| \\leq \\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| \\bigl\\| \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   \\bigr\\|.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   This is an incredibly handy inequality that gets used quite extensively "
"in quantum information (and in many other topics of study).\n"
msgstr "   이 부등식은 양자 정보(및 많은 다른 연구 분야)에서 매우 광범위하게 활용되는 유용한 도구입니다.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Orthogonal and orthonormal sets {#orthogonal-and-orthonormal-sets}"
msgstr "직교 집합과 정규직교 집합 {#orthogonal-and-orthonormal-sets}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two vectors $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ and $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ are said to "
"be *orthogonal* if their inner product is zero:\n"
msgstr ""
"두 벡터 $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$와 $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$의 내적이 0일 때, 이 두 벡터를 "
"*직교(orthogonal)*한다고 합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = 0.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = 0.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Geometrically, we can think about orthogonal vectors as vectors at right "
"angles to each other.\n"
msgstr "기하학적으로, 직교 벡터는 서로 직각을 이루는 벡터로 생각할 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A set of vectors $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is called an *orthogonal set* if every vector in the set is orthogonal to every other vector in the set.\n"
"That is, this set is orthogonal if\n"
msgstr ""
"벡터들의 집합 $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$은 집합 내의 모든 벡터가 서로 직교할 때 *직교 집합(orthogonal set)*이라고 합니다.\n"
"즉, $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$이고 $j\\neq k$인 모든 선택에 대해\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle = 0\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle = 0\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for all choices of $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$ for which $j\\neq k.$\n"
msgstr "이 성립하면 이 집합은 직교 집합입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A set of vectors $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is called an *orthonormal* set if it is an orthogonal set and, in addition, every vector in the set is a unit vector.\n"
"Alternatively, this set is an orthonormal set if we have\n"
msgstr ""
"벡터들의 집합 $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$은 직교 집합이면서 동시에 집합 내의 모든 벡터가 단위 벡터일 때 *정규직교(orthonormal)* 집합이라고 합니다.\n"
"달리 말하면, $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$인 모든 선택에 대해\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & j = k\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & j\\neq k\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\tag{3}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & j = k\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & j\\neq k\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\tag{3}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for all choices of $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}.$\n"
msgstr "가 성립하면 이 집합은 정규직교 집합입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, a set $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is an *orthonormal basis* if, in addition to being an orthonormal set, it forms a basis.\n"
"This is equivalent to $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ being an orthonormal set and $m$ being equal to the dimension of the space from which $\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$ are drawn.\n"
msgstr ""
"마지막으로, 집합 $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$이 정규직교 집합임과 동시에 기저를 이루면 *정규직교 기저(orthonormal basis)*라고 합니다.\n"
"이는 $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$이 정규직교 집합이면서 $m$이 $\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$이 속한 공간의 차원과 같은 것과 동치입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, for any classical state set $\\Sigma,$ the set of all standard "
"basis vectors\n"
msgstr "예를 들어, 임의의 고전적 상태 집합 $\\Sigma$에 대해 모든 표준 기저 벡터들의 집합\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\big\\{ \\vert a \\rangle \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\big\\{ \\vert a \\rangle \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"is an orthonormal basis.\n"
"The set $\\{\\vert+\\rangle,\\vert-\\rangle\\}$ is an orthonormal basis for the $2$-dimensional space corresponding to a single qubit, and the Bell basis $\\{\\vert\\phi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\phi^-\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\}$ is an orthonormal basis for the $4$-dimensional space corresponding to two qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"은 정규직교 기저입니다.\n"
"집합 $\\{\\vert+\\rangle,\\vert-\\rangle\\}$은 단일 Qubit에 해당하는 $2$차원 공간의 정규직교 기저이며, 벨 기저 $\\{\\vert\\phi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\phi^-\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\}$는 두 Qubit에 해당하는 $4$차원 공간의 정규직교 기저입니다.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Extending orthonormal sets to orthonormal bases {#extending-orthonormal-"
"sets-to-orthonormal-bases}"
msgstr ""
"정규직교 집합을 정규직교 기저로 확장하기 {#extending-orthonormal-sets-to-orthonormal-bases}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Suppose that $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$ are vectors that live in an $n$-dimensional space, and assume moreover that $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is an orthonormal set.\n"
"Orthonormal sets are always linearly independent sets, so these vectors necessarily span a subspace of dimension $m.$\n"
"From this we conclude that $m\\leq n$ because the dimension of the subspace spanned by these vectors cannot be larger than the dimension of the entire space from which they're drawn.\n"
msgstr ""
"$\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$이 $n$차원 공간에 속하는 벡터들이고, $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$이 정규직교 집합이라고 가정합니다.\n"
"정규직교 집합은 항상 선형 독립 집합이므로, 이 벡터들은 반드시 차원 $m$의 부분 공간을 생성합니다.\n"
"이 벡터들이 생성하는 부분 공간의 차원이 전체 공간의 차원보다 클 수 없으므로, $m\\leq n$임을 알 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If it is the case that $m<n,$ then it is always possible to choose an additional $n-m$ vectors\n"
"$\\vert \\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$ so that\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$ forms an orthonormal basis.\n"
"A procedure known as the *Gram–Schmidt orthogonalization process* can be used to construct these vectors.\n"
msgstr ""
"$m<n$인 경우에는, 추가로 $n-m$개의 벡터 $\\vert \\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$을 선택하여\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$이 정규직교 기저를 이루도록 하는 것이 항상 가능합니다.\n"
"이러한 벡터들을 구성하는 데는 *그람-슈미트 정규직교화(Gram–Schmidt orthogonalization)* 과정이 사용될 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Orthonormal sets and unitary matrices {#orthonormal-sets-and-unitary-"
"matrices}"
msgstr "정규직교 집합과 유니터리 행렬 {#orthonormal-sets-and-unitary-matrices}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Orthonormal sets of vectors are closely connected with unitary matrices.\n"
"One way to express this connection is to say that the following three statements are logically equivalent (meaning that they are all true or all false) for any choice of a square matrix $U$:\n"
msgstr ""
"정규직교 벡터 집합은 유니터리 행렬과 밀접하게 연결되어 있습니다.\n"
"이 연결을 표현하는 한 가지 방법은, 임의의 정방 행렬 $U$에 대해 다음 세 가지 명제가 논리적으로 동치(모두 참이거나 모두 거짓)라고 말하는 것입니다.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The matrix $U$ is unitary (that is, $U^{\\dagger} U = \\mathbb{I} = U "
"U^{\\dagger}$).\n"
msgstr "행렬 $U$는 유니터리이다 (즉, $U^{\\dagger} U = \\mathbb{I} = U U^{\\dagger}$).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The rows of $U$ form an orthonormal set.\n"
msgstr "$U$의 행들이 정규직교 집합을 이룬다.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The columns of $U$ form an orthonormal set.\n"
msgstr "$U$의 열들이 정규직교 집합을 이룬다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This equivalence is actually pretty straightforward when we think about how matrix multiplication and the conjugate transpose work.\n"
"Suppose, for instance, that we have a $3\\times 3$ matrix like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"이 동치 관계는 행렬 곱셈과 켤레 전치가 어떻게 작동하는지를 생각해보면 사실 꽤 명확합니다.\n"
"예를 들어, 다음과 같은 $3\\times 3$ 행렬이 있다고 가정합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The conjugate transpose of $U$ looks like this:\n"
msgstr "$U$의 켤레 전치는 다음과 같습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Multiplying the two matrices, with the conjugate transpose on the left-hand "
"side, gives us this matrix:\n"
msgstr "켤레 전치를 왼쪽에 두고 두 행렬을 곱하면 다음 행렬을 얻습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"&\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[4mm]\n"
"\\quad &=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"&\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[4mm]\n"
"\\quad &=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If we form three vectors from the columns of $U,$\n"
msgstr "$U$의 열들로부터 세 벡터를 구성하면,\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_2\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,2}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_3\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_2\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,2}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_3\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "then we can alternatively express the product above as follows:\n"
msgstr "위의 곱을 다음과 같이 다르게 표현할 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} U =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} U =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Referring to the equation $(3),$ we now see that the condition that this "
"matrix is equal to the identity matrix is equivalent to the orthonormality "
"of the set "
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_2\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_3\\rangle\\}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"식 $(3)$을 참조하면, 이 행렬이 단위 행렬과 같다는 조건이 집합 "
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_2\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_3\\rangle\\}$의 "
"정규직교성과 동치임을 알 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This argument generalizes to unitary matrices of any size.\n"
"The fact that the rows of a matrix form an orthonormal basis if and only if the matrix is unitary then follows from the fact that a matrix is unitary if and only if its transpose is unitary.\n"
msgstr ""
"이 논증은 임의의 크기의 유니터리 행렬로 일반화됩니다.\n"
"행렬의 행들이 정규직교 기저를 이룰 필요충분조건이 그 행렬이 유니터리인 것이라는 사실은, 행렬이 유니터리인 것과 그 전치 행렬이 유니터리인 것이 동치라는 사실로부터 따릅니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Given the equivalence described above, together with the fact that every orthonormal set can be extended to form an orthonormal basis, we conclude the following useful fact:\n"
"Given any orthonormal set of vectors $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ drawn from an $n$-dimensional space, there exists a unitary matrix $U$ whose first $m$ columns are the vectors $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle.$\n"
"Pictorially, we can always find a unitary matrix having this form:\n"
msgstr ""
"위에서 설명한 동치 관계와 함께, 모든 정규직교 집합을 정규직교 기저로 확장할 수 있다는 사실을 이용하면 다음과 같은 유용한 결론을 얻을 수 있습니다.\n"
"$n$차원 공간에서 추출한 임의의 정규직교 벡터 집합 $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$에 대해, 처음 $m$개의 열이 벡터 $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$인 유니터리 행렬 $U$가 존재합니다.\n"
"그림으로 표현하면, 항상 다음 형태의 유니터리 행렬을 찾을 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U =\n"
"\\left(\n"
"  \\begin{array}{ccccccc}\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\\\\\n"
"    \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_2\\rangle & \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_m\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle &\n"
"    \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\n"
"  \\end{array}\n"
"\\right).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U =\n"
"\\left(\n"
"  \\begin{array}{ccccccc}\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\\\\\n"
"    \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_2\\rangle & \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_m\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle &\n"
"    \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\n"
"  \\end{array}\n"
"\\right).\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, the last $n-m$ columns are filled in with any choice of vectors $\\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$ that make\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$ an orthonormal basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"여기서 나머지 $n-m$개의 열은 "
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$이 정규직교 기저를 이루도록 "
"하는 임의의 벡터 $\\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$으로 "
"채워집니다.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Projections and projective measurements {#projections-and-projective-"
"measurements}"
msgstr "사영과 사영 측정 {#projections-and-projective-measurements}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Projection matrices {#projection-matrices}"
msgstr "사영 행렬 {#projection-matrices}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A square matrix $\\Pi$ is called a *projection* if it satisfies two "
"properties:\n"
msgstr "정방 행렬 $\\Pi$가 다음 두 가지 성질을 만족하면 *사영(projection)*이라고 합니다.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$\\Pi = \\Pi^{\\dagger}.$\n"
msgstr "$\\Pi = \\Pi^{\\dagger}.$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$\\Pi^2 = \\Pi.$\n"
msgstr "$\\Pi^2 = \\Pi.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Matrices that satisfy the first condition — that they are equal to their own"
" conjugate transpose — are called *Hermitian matrices*, and matrices that "
"satisfy the second condition — that squaring them leaves them unchanged — "
"are called *idempotent* matrices.\n"
msgstr ""
"첫 번째 조건, 즉 자기 자신의 켤레 전치와 같은 행렬을 *에르미트 행렬(Hermitian matrix)*이라 하고, 두 번째 조건, 즉"
" 제곱해도 변하지 않는 행렬을 *멱등(idempotent)* 행렬이라 합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As a word of caution, the word *projection* is sometimes used to refer to any matrix that satisfies just the second condition but not necessarily the first, and when this is done the term *orthogonal projection* is typically used to refer to matrices satisfying both properties.\n"
"In the context of quantum information and computation, however, the terms *projection* and *projection matrix* more typically refer to matrices satisfying both conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"주의할 점으로, *사영*이라는 용어는 때로 두 번째 조건만 만족하고 첫 번째 조건은 반드시 만족하지 않는 행렬을 가리키는 데 쓰이기도 합니다. 이 경우 두 조건을 모두 만족하는 행렬을 가리키기 위해 *직교 사영(orthogonal projection)*이라는 용어를 사용합니다.\n"
"그러나 양자 정보 및 계산의 맥락에서는 *사영* 또는 *사영 행렬*이 두 조건을 모두 만족하는 행렬을 가리키는 것이 일반적입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "An example of a projection is the matrix\n"
msgstr "사영의 예로, 임의의 단위 벡터 $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$에 대해 다음 행렬이 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert\n"
"\\tag{4}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert\n"
"\\tag{4}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for any unit vector $\\vert \\psi\\rangle.$\n"
"We can see that this matrix is Hermitian as follows:\n"
msgstr "이 행렬이 에르미트임은 다음과 같이 확인할 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger} = \\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\bigl( \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger} = \\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\bigl( \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Here, to obtain the second equality, we have used the formula\n"
msgstr "여기서 두 번째 등호를 얻기 위해 다음 공식을 사용했습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"(A B)^{\\dagger} = B^{\\dagger} A^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"(A B)^{\\dagger} = B^{\\dagger} A^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"which is always true, for any two matrices $A$ and $B$ for which the product"
" $AB$ makes sense.\n"
msgstr "이는 곱 $AB$가 정의되는 임의의 두 행렬 $A$와 $B$에 대해 항상 성립합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To see that the matrix $\\Pi$ in $(4)$ is idempotent, we can use the assumption that $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is a unit vector, so that it satisfies $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi\\rangle = 1.$\n"
"Thus, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"$(4)$의 행렬 $\\Pi$가 멱등임을 확인하기 위해, $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$가 단위 벡터이므로 $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi\\rangle = 1$을 만족한다는 가정을 활용합니다.\n"
"따라서 다음이 성립합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"= \\bigl( \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert \\bigr)^2\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"= \\bigl( \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert \\bigr)^2\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"More generally, if $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert "
"\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is any orthonormal set of vectors, then the matrix\n"
msgstr ""
"더 일반적으로, $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}$이 임의의 "
"정규직교 집합이면, 다음 행렬\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\tag{5}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\tag{5}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"is a projection.\n"
"Specifically, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"은 사영입니다.\n"
"구체적으로 다음이 성립합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger}\n"
"&= \\biggl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\bigl(\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k\\vert\\bigr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"&= \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger}\n"
"&= \\biggl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\bigl(\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k\\vert\\bigr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"&= \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and\n"
msgstr "그리고\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"& = \\biggl( \\sum_{j = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert\\Bigr)\\Bigl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{j = 1}^m\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert  \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"& = \\biggl( \\sum_{j = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert\\Bigr)\\Bigl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{j = 1}^m\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert  \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the orthonormality of $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert "
"\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ implies the second-to-last equality.\n"
msgstr ""
"여기서 $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}$의 정규직교성이 "
"끝에서 두 번째 등호를 보장합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In fact, this exhausts all of the possibilities: *every* projection $\\Pi$ can be written in the form $(5)$ for some choice of an orthonormal set $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}.$\n"
"(Technically speaking, the zero matrix $\\Pi=0,$ which is a projection, is a special case.\n"
"To fit it into the general form $(5)$ we must allow the possibility that the sum is empty, resulting in the zero matrix.)\n"
msgstr ""
"사실 이것으로 모든 경우가 설명됩니다. *모든* 사영 $\\Pi$는 어떤 정규직교 집합 $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}$에 대해 형태 $(5)$로 쓸 수 있습니다.\n"
"(엄밀히 말하면, 사영인 영행렬 $\\Pi=0$은 특수한 경우입니다.\n"
"이를 일반적인 형태 $(5)$에 맞추려면 합이 공집합인 경우, 즉 영행렬이 되는 경우를 허용해야 합니다.)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Projective measurements {#projective-measurements}"
msgstr "사영 측정 {#projective-measurements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The notion of a measurement of a quantum system is more general than just standard basis measurements.\n"
"*Projective measurements* are measurements that are described by a collection of projections whose sum is equal to the identity matrix.\n"
"In symbols, a collection $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ of projection matrices describes a projective measurement if\n"
msgstr ""
"양자 시스템에 대한 측정의 개념은 표준 기저 측정보다 더 일반적입니다.\n"
"*사영 측정(projective measurement)*은 합이 항등 행렬이 되는 사영들의 모음으로 기술되는 측정입니다.\n"
"기호로 나타내면, 사영 행렬들의 모음 $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$이 사영 측정을 기술하려면 다음을 만족해야 합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 + \\cdots + \\Pi_{m-1} = \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 + \\cdots + \\Pi_{m-1} = \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When such a measurement is performed on a system $\\mathsf{X}$ while it is "
"in some state $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$ two things happen:\n"
msgstr ""
"이러한 측정을 어떤 상태 $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$에 있는 시스템 $\\mathsf{X}$에 수행하면 두 가지 일이 "
"일어납니다.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For each $k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\},$ the outcome of the measurement is $k$ "
"with probability equal to\n"
msgstr "각 $k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$에 대해, 측정 결과가 $k$일 확률은 다음과 같습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $k$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $k$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For whichever outcome $k$ the measurement produces, the state of "
"$\\mathsf{X}$ becomes\n"
msgstr "측정에서 어떤 결과 $k$가 나오든, $\\mathsf{X}$의 상태는 다음이 됩니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can also choose outcomes other than $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$ for projective measurements if we wish.\n"
"More generally, for any finite and nonempty set $\\Sigma,$ if we have a collection of projection matrices\n"
msgstr ""
"원한다면 사영 측정의 결과를 $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$ 이외의 집합으로 선택할 수도 있습니다.\n"
"더 일반적으로, 유한하고 비어 있지 않은 집합 $\\Sigma$에 대해, 사영 행렬들의 모음\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\{\\Pi_a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\{\\Pi_a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "that satisfies the condition\n"
msgstr "이 다음 조건을 만족하면\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\Pi_a = \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\Pi_a = \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"then this collection describes a projective measurement whose possible "
"outcomes coincide with the set $\\Sigma,$ where the rules are the same as "
"before:\n"
msgstr "이 모음은 가능한 결과가 집합 $\\Sigma$와 일치하는 사영 측정을 기술하며, 규칙은 이전과 동일합니다.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For each $a\\in\\Sigma,$ the outcome of the measurement is $a$ with "
"probability equal to\n"
msgstr "각 $a\\in\\Sigma$에 대해, 측정 결과가 $a$일 확률은 다음과 같습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $a$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_a \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $a$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_a \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For whichever outcome $a$ the measurement produces, the state of "
"$\\mathsf{X}$ becomes\n"
msgstr "측정에서 어떤 결과 $a$가 나오든, $\\mathsf{X}$의 상태는 다음이 됩니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, standard basis measurements are equivalent to projective measurements, where $\\Sigma$ is the set of classical states of whatever system $\\mathsf{X}$ we're talking about and our set of projection matrices is\n"
"$\\{\\vert a\\rangle\\langle a\\vert:a\\in\\Sigma\\}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"예를 들어, 표준 기저 측정은 사영 측정과 동등합니다. 이때 $\\Sigma$는 대상 시스템 $\\mathsf{X}$의 고전 상태 "
"집합이고, 사영 행렬들의 집합은 $\\{\\vert a\\rangle\\langle "
"a\\vert:a\\in\\Sigma\\}$입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Another example of a projective measurement, this time on two qubits $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}),$ is given by the set\n"
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\},$ where\n"
msgstr ""
"사영 측정의 또 다른 예로, 두 Qubit $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$에 대한 집합 "
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\}$이 있습니다. 여기서\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 = \\vert \\phi^+\\rangle\\langle \\phi^+ \\vert + \\vert \\phi^-\\rangle\\langle \\phi^- \\vert + \\vert \\psi^+\\rangle\\langle \\psi^+ \\vert\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\Pi_1 = \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\langle\\psi^-\\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 = \\vert \\phi^+\\rangle\\langle \\phi^+ \\vert + \\vert \\phi^-\\rangle\\langle \\phi^- \\vert + \\vert \\psi^+\\rangle\\langle \\psi^+ \\vert\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\Pi_1 = \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\langle\\psi^-\\vert.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If we have multiple systems that are jointly in some quantum state and a "
"projective measurement is performed on just one of the systems, the action "
"is similar to what we had for standard basis measurements — and in fact we "
"can now describe this action in much simpler terms than we could before.\n"
msgstr ""
"여러 시스템이 함께 어떤 양자 상태에 있고 그 중 하나의 시스템에 사영 측정이 수행되는 경우, 그 작용은 표준 기저 측정에서의 경우와 "
"유사합니다. 실제로 이제는 이전보다 훨씬 간결하게 이 작용을 기술할 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To be precise, let us suppose that we have two systems $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ in a quantum state $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$ and a projective measurement described by a collection $\\{\\Pi_a : a\\in\\Sigma\\}$ is performed on the system $\\mathsf{X},$ while nothing is done to $\\mathsf{Y}.$\n"
"Doing this is then equivalent to performing the projective measurement described by the collection\n"
msgstr ""
"구체적으로, 두 시스템 $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$이 양자 상태 $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$에 있고, $\\mathsf{Y}$에는 아무것도 하지 않은 채 시스템 $\\mathsf{X}$에 $\\{\\Pi_a : a\\in\\Sigma\\}$로 기술되는 사영 측정이 수행된다고 가정합니다.\n"
"이는 결합 시스템 $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$에 다음 모음으로 기술되는 사영 측정을 수행하는 것과 동등합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\{ \\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I} \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\{ \\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I} \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"on the joint system $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}).$\n"
"Each measurement outcome $a$ results with probability\n"
msgstr "각 측정 결과 $a$가 나올 확률은\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and conditioned on the result $a$ appearing, the state of the joint system "
"$(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ becomes\n"
msgstr "이고, 결과 $a$가 나온 것을 조건으로 결합 시스템 $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$의 상태는 다음이 됩니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{(\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{(\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Implementing projective measurements {#implementing-projective-measurements}"
msgstr "사영 측정의 구현 {#implementing-projective-measurements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Arbitrary projective measurements can be implemented using unitary "
"operations, standard basis measurements, and an extra workspace system, as "
"will now be explained.\n"
msgstr ""
"임의의 사영 측정은 유니터리 연산, 표준 기저 측정, 그리고 추가적인 작업 공간 시스템을 사용하여 구현할 수 있습니다. 이에 대해 "
"지금부터 설명합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let us suppose that $\\mathsf{X}$ is a system and "
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ is a projective measurement on "
"$\\mathsf{X}.$ We can easily generalize this discussion to projective "
"measurements having different sets of outcomes, but in the interest of "
"convenience and simplicity we will assume the set of possible outcomes for "
"our measurement is $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"$\\mathsf{X}$가 시스템이고 $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$이 $\\mathsf{X}$에 대한 사영"
" 측정이라고 가정합니다. 결과 집합이 다른 사영 측정으로 이 논의를 쉽게 일반화할 수 있지만, 편의상 측정의 가능한 결과 집합이 "
"$\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$이라고 가정합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let us note explicitly that $m$ is not necessarily equal to the number of "
"classical states of $\\mathsf{X}$ — we'll let $n$ be the number of classical"
" states of $\\mathsf{X},$ which means that each matrix $\\Pi_k$ is an "
"$n\\times n$ projection matrix.\n"
msgstr ""
"$m$이 반드시 $\\mathsf{X}$의 고전 상태 수와 같을 필요는 없다는 점을 명시적으로 언급합니다. $\\mathsf{X}$의 "
"고전 상태 수를 $n$이라 하면, 각 행렬 $\\Pi_k$는 $n\\times n$ 사영 행렬입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because we assume that $\\{\\Pi_0\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ represents a "
"projective measurement, it is necessarily the case that\n"
msgstr "$\\{\\Pi_0\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$이 사영 측정을 나타낸다고 가정했으므로, 다음이 반드시 성립합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\Pi_k = \\mathbb{I}_n.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\Pi_k = \\mathbb{I}_n.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our goal is to perform a process that has the same effect as performing this"
" projective measurement on $\\mathsf{X},$ but to do this using only unitary "
"operations and standard basis measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"우리의 목표는 $\\mathsf{X}$에 이 사영 측정을 수행하는 것과 동일한 효과를 내되, 유니터리 연산과 표준 기저 측정만을 사용하여"
" 이를 달성하는 것입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will make use of an extra workspace system $\\mathsf{Y}$ to do this, and specifically we'll take the classical state set of $\\mathsf{Y}$ to be $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\},$ which is the same as the set of outcomes of the projective measurement.\n"
"The idea is that we will perform a standard basis measurement on $\\mathsf{Y},$ and interpret the outcome of this measurement as being equivalent to the outcome of the projective measurement on $\\mathsf{X}.$\n"
"We'll need to assume that $\\mathsf{Y}$ is initialized to some fixed state, which we'll choose to be $\\vert 0\\rangle.$\n"
"(Any other choice of fixed quantum state vector could be made to work, but choosing $\\vert 0\\rangle$ makes the explanation to follow much simpler.)\n"
msgstr ""
"이를 위해 추가 작업 공간 시스템 $\\mathsf{Y}$를 활용합니다. 구체적으로, $\\mathsf{Y}$의 고전 상태 집합을 $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$로 설정하는데, 이는 사영 측정의 결과 집합과 동일합니다.\n"
"아이디어는 $\\mathsf{Y}$에 표준 기저 측정을 수행하고, 이 측정의 결과를 $\\mathsf{X}$에 대한 사영 측정의 결과와 동등한 것으로 해석하는 것입니다.\n"
"$\\mathsf{Y}$는 어떤 고정된 상태로 초기화되어 있다고 가정해야 하는데, 여기서는 $\\vert 0\\rangle$을 선택합니다.\n"
"(다른 고정된 양자 상태 벡터를 선택해도 작동하지만, $\\vert 0\\rangle$을 선택하면 이후 설명이 훨씬 간단해집니다.)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Of course, in order for a standard basis measurement of $\\mathsf{Y}$ to tell us anything about $\\mathsf{X},$ we will need to allow $\\mathsf{X}$ and $\\mathsf{Y}$ to interact somehow before measuring $\\mathsf{Y},$ by performing a unitary operation on the system $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X}).$\n"
"First consider this matrix:\n"
msgstr ""
"물론, $\\mathsf{Y}$의 표준 기저 측정이 $\\mathsf{X}$에 대한 정보를 알려주려면, $\\mathsf{Y}$를 측정하기 전에 $\\mathsf{X}$와 $\\mathsf{Y}$가 결합 시스템 $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$에 유니터리 연산을 수행하는 방식으로 서로 상호작용해야 합니다.\n"
"먼저 다음 행렬을 고려합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\Pi_k.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\Pi_k.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Expressed explicitly as a so-called *block matrix*, which is essentially a "
"matrix of matrices that we interpret as a single, larger matrix, $M$ looks "
"like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"소위 *블록 행렬(block matrix)*, 즉 하나의 더 큰 행렬로 해석되는 행렬들의 행렬로 명시적으로 나타내면, $M$은 다음과 "
"같습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & 0 & \\cdots & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & 0 & \\cdots & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, each $0$ represents an $n\\times n$ matrix filled entirely with zeros,"
" so that the entire matrix $M$ is an $nm\\times nm$ matrix.\n"
msgstr ""
"여기서 각 $0$은 완전히 영으로 채워진 $n\\times n$ 행렬을 나타내므로, 전체 행렬 $M$은 $nm\\times nm$ "
"행렬입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now, $M$ is certainly not a unitary matrix (unless $m=1,$ in which case "
"$\\Pi_0 = \\mathbb{I},$ giving $M = \\mathbb{I}$ in this trivial case) "
"because unitary matrices cannot have any columns (or rows) that are entirely"
" $0;$ unitary matrices have columns that form orthonormal bases, and the "
"all-zero vector is not a unit vector.\n"
msgstr ""
"$M$은 ($m=1$인 경우 $\\Pi_0 = \\mathbb{I}$이므로 $M = \\mathbb{I}$가 되는 자명한 경우를 "
"제외하면) 분명히 유니터리 행렬이 아닙니다. 유니터리 행렬은 완전히 영인 열(또는 행)을 가질 수 없기 때문입니다. 유니터리 행렬의 "
"열들은 정규직교 기저를 이루어야 하는데, 영벡터는 단위 벡터가 아닙니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"However, it is the case that the first $n$ columns of $M$ are orthonormal, and we get this from the assumption that $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ is a measurement.\n"
"To verify this claim, notice that for each $j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},$ the vector formed by column number $j$ of $M$ is as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"그러나 행렬 $M$의 처음 $n$개의 열은 정규직교하며, 이는 $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$이 측정이라는 가정에서 비롯됩니다.\n"
"이를 확인하기 위해, 각 $j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$에 대해 $M$의 $j$번째 열로 이루어진 벡터가 다음과 같음을 주목합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_j\\rangle = M \\vert 0, j\\rangle = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_j\\rangle = M \\vert 0, j\\rangle = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that here we're numbering the columns starting from column $0.$ Taking "
"the inner product of column $i$ with column $j$ when "
"$i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ gives\n"
msgstr ""
"여기서 열 번호는 $0$부터 시작합니다. $i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$일 때 $i$번째 열과 $j$번째 열의 내적을"
" 계산하면\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_i \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"& =\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert i\\rangle\\biggr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1} \\vert l \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle k \\vert l \\rangle \\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\langle i \\vert \\mathbb{I} \\vert j \\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & i = j\\\\\n"
"0 & i\\neq j,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_i \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"& =\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert i\\rangle\\biggr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1} \\vert l \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle k \\vert l \\rangle \\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\langle i \\vert \\mathbb{I} \\vert j \\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & i = j\\\\\n"
"0 & i\\neq j,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "which is what we needed to show.\n"
msgstr "이로써 증명이 완료됩니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thus, because the first $n$ columns of the matrix $M$ are orthonormal, we "
"can replace all of the remaining zero entries by some different choice of "
"complex number entries so that the entire matrix is unitary.\n"
msgstr ""
"따라서 행렬 $M$의 처음 $n$개의 열이 정규직교하므로, 나머지 영 항목들을 다른 복소수 항목들로 대체하여 전체 행렬을 유니터리로 만들"
" 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If we're given the matrices $\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1},$ we can compute "
"suitable matrices to fill in for the blocks marked $\\fbox{?}$ in the "
"equation — using the Gram–Schmidt process — but it does not matter "
"specifically what these matrices are for the sake of this discussion.\n"
msgstr ""
"행렬 $\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}$이 주어지면, Gram–Schmidt 과정을 사용하여 방정식에서 "
"$\\fbox{?}$로 표시된 블록들을 채울 적절한 행렬들을 계산할 수 있습니다. 하지만 이 논의의 목적상 이 행렬들이 구체적으로 "
"무엇인지는 중요하지 않습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally we can describe the measurement process: we first perform $U$ on the joint system $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$ and then measure $\\mathsf{Y}$ with respect to a standard basis measurement.\n"
"For an arbitrary state $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ of $\\mathsf{X},$ we obtain the state\n"
msgstr ""
"마지막으로 측정 과정을 기술할 수 있습니다. 먼저 결합 시스템 $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$에 $U$를 수행한 다음, $\\mathsf{Y}$에 표준 기저 측정을 수행합니다.\n"
"$\\mathsf{X}$의 임의의 상태 $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$에 대해, 다음 상태를 얻습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= M \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert\\phi\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= M \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert\\phi\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the first equality follows from the fact that $U$ and $M$ agree on their first $n$ columns.\n"
"When we perform a projective measurement on $\\mathsf{Y},$ we obtain each outcome $k$ with probability\n"
msgstr ""
"여기서 첫 번째 등호는 $U$와 $M$이 처음 $n$개의 열에서 일치한다는 사실에서 비롯됩니다.\n"
"$\\mathsf{Y}$에 사영 측정을 수행하면, 각 결과 $k$가 다음 확률로 나옵니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "in which case the state of $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$ becomes\n"
msgstr "이 경우 $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$의 상태는 다음이 됩니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thus, $\\mathsf{Y}$ stores a copy of the measurement outcome and "
"$\\mathsf{X}$ changes precisely as it would had the projective measurement "
"described by $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ been performed directly on "
"$\\mathsf{X}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"따라서 $\\mathsf{Y}$는 측정 결과의 사본을 저장하고, $\\mathsf{X}$는 "
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$로 기술되는 사영 측정이 $\\mathsf{X}$에 직접 수행되었을 경우와 "
"정확히 동일하게 변합니다.\n"
